  "bodyHash": "5cfa93a6b2309ba1",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/infinitybuttons/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"Infinity Buttons\"></p>\n<h3>Infinity Buttons 是一个添加了令人兴奋的新按钮的模组！</h3>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>是否觉得那些烦人的小按钮总是不够用？试试 Infinity Buttons！这个模组添加了许多酷炫的新按钮，为你的 Minecraft 体验增添乐趣。跑步时总是错过门上的小按钮？试试大按钮！想要制造一些爆炸效果？紧急按钮可以满足你。想要隐藏你的基地？秘密按钮能帮上大忙！当然，按钮的种类远不止这些，就在本文本下方还列出了更多按钮。</p>\n<h3>此模组添加了哪些按钮？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>大按钮：比普通按钮更大。</li>\n<li>不同材质的按钮：每种材质具有不同的功能。</li>\n<li>紧急按钮：提供全部 16 种颜色，以及特殊的彩虹变体。可选择带或不带玻璃外壳！它们还会发出警报声。</li>\n<li>秘密按钮：能与墙壁完美融合。包含书架、砖块、木板等样式。即使使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a> 也无法发现这些按钮！</li>\n<li>火把按钮和拉杆：还提供灵魂火把和红石火把形态。</li>\n<li>灯笼按钮：在链子的顶部提供红石信号。</li>\n<li>门铃！</li>\n<li>特殊按钮：如控制台按钮、字母按钮和灯泡按钮。</li>\n<li>沙子、红沙、砾石和混凝土粉末按钮：这些按钮只能被按下一次。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/infinitybuttons/emergency.png\" alt=\"Emergency Button\">\n<img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/infinitybuttons/all_buttons.png\" alt=\"All Buttons\"></p>\n<h3>重要提示！此模组有依赖项！</h3>\n<p>安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fevery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Every Compat (Wood Good)</a> 以支持模组木材的兼容性！</p>\n<h4>Fabric:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>(1.19+) 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fowo-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">oωo lib</a>！</li>\n<li>(1.18.2) 需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可以不安装以下模组运行，但安装后可获得额外内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> (1.18.2 &amp; 1.19.2)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight</a> (1.18.2 &amp; 1.19.2)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpenter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpenter</a> (1.18.2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Forge:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可以不安装以下模组运行，但安装后可获得额外内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquarkmod.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> (1.18.2+)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woodworks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodworks</a> (1.18.2+)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpenter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpenter</a> (1.18.2)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Endergetic Expansion</a> (1.16.5)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fabundance\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abundance</a> (1.16.5)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bamboo-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bamboo Blocks</a> (1.16.5)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbayou-blues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bayou Blues</a> (1.16.5)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhanced-mushrooms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Mushrooms</a> (1.16.5)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buzzier-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buzzier Bees</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/savage-and-ravage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Savage &amp; Ravage</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fteamdiopside.nl%252fdiscord%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/diopside/Serverbanner.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
